OL,3,GNEWSATeenager and parents died in
OL,4,A100mph motorway crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager and his parents were killed
OL,7,Fwhen their BMW collided with a motorway
OL,8,Fcrash barrier at speeds of 100mph, an
OL,9,Finquest has heard.
OL,11,FAndrew Moore, 46, Swala Harling, 47,
OL,12,Fand Sebastian Moore, 14, died when
OL,13,Ftheir car left the northbound
OL,14,Fcarriageway of the M5 near Michaelwood
OL,15,FServices on 30 May 2025.
OL,17,FWitnesses told an inquest at Avon
OL,18,FCoroner's Court on Tuesday that they
OL,19,Fhad spotted the vehicle crossing lanes
OL,20,Fand driving up the hard shoulder at
OL,21,Fhigh speed.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
