OL,3,GNEWSATeenager and parents died in
OL,4,A100mph motorway crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FCoroner Dr Peter Harrowing said there
OL,7,Fwas "insufficient evidence" to support
OL,8,Fa conclusion that Andrew had suffered a
OL,9,Fmedical episode or crashed the car on
OL,10,Fpurpose. He recorded conclusions of
OL,11,Fdeaths caused by a road traffic
OL,12,Fcollision.
